# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Oversized ProPresenter reference exports in _temp/ (#1968)
#
# ELI5: these four sample files are too big for GitHub, so we keep them on the
# developer's own machine instead of in the repo.
#
# Detail: GitHub hard-rejects any single file over 100 MB at the pre-receive
# hook (https://docs.github.com/repositories/working-with-files/managing-large-files/about-large-files-on-github),
# and warns above 50 MB. These are 813 MB / 364 MB / 117 MB / 82 MB — they are
# large only because ProPresenter embeds the service's VIDEO and image media
# inside the .proplaylist / .protheme / .probundle container. As parser
# fixtures they add nothing over the small samples that ARE tracked beside
# them (0.1–5.6 MB), which already exercise every element of the format the
# #1968 importer/exporter round-trips. Keep new media-laden exports out too:
# add the path here rather than reaching for Git LFS, which would need a paid
# data pack (free tier is 1 GB) and would bill bandwidth on every clone and
# every deploy.yml checkout.
#
# NB: '[' and ']' are glob character-class metacharacters in .gitignore, hence
# the backslash escapes on the [Video] filename below.
/_temp/_ProPresenter Sample Files/2026-08-22 - Baby Dedication.proplaylist
/_temp/_ProPresenter Sample Files/00 - Announcements - Mill Road.proplaylist
/_temp/_ProPresenter Sample Files/Mill Rd 2024_theme.protheme
/_temp/_ProPresenter Sample Files/Here To Stay (Anthem Worship LLUC)\[Video\].probundle

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets in appWeb/.auth/ (DB credentials + the secret-encryption master key, #1466)
# The REAL files (db_credentials.php, secrets_master_key.php) are NEVER committed —
# the `appWeb/.auth/*` glob ignores everything; only the *.example.php templates and
# the deny-all .htaccess are un-ignored below.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
appWeb/.auth/*
!appWeb/.auth/.htaccess
!appWeb/.auth/db_credentials.example.php
!appWeb/.auth/secrets_master_key.example.php

